==Battleground==
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.
*1 [[Razorback]] spawns as the boss after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Lure Razorback extra-close to your base and then use units like [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Cat Eastwood]], [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]], [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]] and other such [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark units]] to freeze/slow/weaken Razorback and then kill him as quickly as possible with units like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] before the Mr. Mole gets close enough to help. Using [[Cat Combo]]s to increase the length of the aforementioned effects is recommended if you can't seem to keep him down long enough.
Alternatively, you can cheese the stage by rushing it before Razorback has a chance to spawn.

