==Trivia==
*The English name of this stage is a referenced to the 1977 James Bond movie, ''[[wikipedia:The Spy Who Loved Me (film)|The Spy Who Loved Me]]''. The Japanese name, From a Spy with Love, references a different James Bond movie: ''[[wikipedia:From Russia with Love (film)|From Russia with Love]]''.

